OL,3,GNEWSA'Wannabe Vin Diesel' has car
OL,4,Aseized at illegal meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver had his Volkswagen car seized
OL,7,Ffor trying to block a road at an
OL,8,Fillegal car cruise.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said it had
OL,11,Freceived intelligence that a large
OL,12,Fgroup was planning to gather in Castle
OL,13,FDonington on Saturday night which
OL,14,F"proved correct" and its officers
OL,15,Fintercepted and dispersed a number
OL,16,Fattempting to drag race in the village.
OL,18,FOne vehicle was seized, said Valley
OL,19,FBeat officers, after a driver "decided
OL,20,Fit would be a good idea to block the
OL,21,Froad, seemingly trying to recreate a
OL,22,Fscene from Fast & Furious".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
