OL,3,GNEWSA'Wannabe Vin Diesel' has car
OL,4,Aseized at illegal meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FPCSO Mike Walker added: "Unfortunately
OL,7,Ffor him, he was no Vin Diesel and
OL,8,Finstead found himself on the receiving
OL,9,Fend of a vehicle seizure and a fine."
